title: Start
---
<<declare $gameOver = false>>
<<declare $currentCycle = 0>>
    <<jump Start2>>
===

title: Start2
---
<<playSFX 1>>
Me: What a beautiful day to pick some flowers.

<<if $gameOver == true>>
    <<if $currentCycle == 1>>
        PlayTester: I guess the game is over now...
    <<elseif $currentCycle == 2>>
        PlayTester: There's nothing more in the game to see or do...
    <<elseif $currentCycle == 3>>
        PlayTester: I should really stop playing this game now...
    <<elseif $currentCycle == 4>>
        PlayTester: Why am I still playing this game? I have seen everything there is to see...
    <<elseif $currentCycle >= 5>>
        PlayTester: ...
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: TalkingAboutFlowers
---
<<playSFX 1>>
Me:I should pick those flowers over there.
    <<stop>>
===

title: RedFlowers
---
<<playSFX 1>>
Me:Why are the flowers red?
    <<jump plantDialogue>>
