title: WheresTheOldMan
---
<<playSFX 1>>
Me: Where is that old man?
    <<stop>>
===

title: NightOneDialogue
---
<<playSFX 1>>
Me: I think I have picked enough flowers for today. I should head back home.
    <<stop>>
===

title: NightTwoDialogue
---
<<playSFX 1>>
Me: I think I have picked enough flowers for today. I wonder if I will see the old man tomorrow.
<<playSFX 1>>
Me: I should head back home.
    <<stop>>
===

title: NightThreeDialogue
---
<<playSFX 1>>
Me: What have I been doing? These flowers... people..?
<<playSFX 1>>
Me: I am losing my mind. I need to get some rest.
    <<stop>>
===

title: DayOneEndDialogue
---
<<playSFX 1>>
Me: I'm tired. I hope tomorrow will be just as bright as today.
    <<stop>>
===

title: DayTwoEndDialogue
---
<<playSFX 1>>
Me: The old man keeps coming back on my mind. I wonder if I will see him again.
    <<stop>>
===

title: DayThreeEndDialogue
---
<<playSFX 1>>
Me: I am a monster.. I am a monster.. I am a monster.. I am a monster.. I am a monster.. I am a monster.. I am a monster.. I am a monster..
Me: No.......
    <<set $currentCycle to $currentCycle + 1>>
    <<set $gameOver = true>>
    <<jump Start2>>
===